### Doctor + prescriptions.cancel + patient scope + doctor authority + CSRF.
POST {{StaffHost}}/api/staff/patients/{{PatientId}}/prescriptions/{{PrescriptionId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{StaffCookie}}; {{CsrfCookie}}
